{"channelId":"UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","row":["University Hospitals",32700,"Founded in 1866, University Hospitals has grown over the last 150 years to become what it is today – one of the nation’s leading health care systems, committed to providing high-quality, patient-centered medical care to the residents of Northeast Ohio. Our facilities include a thriving academic medical center, consistently ranked among the nation’s top hospitals by U.S. News & World Report, along with 18 hospitals, 40 health centers and dozens of medical practices throughout a 15-county region. \n\nAt UH, our national reputation for providing high-quality care, our direct involvement in pioneering medical advancements and clinical discoveries, and a continued commitment to training the next generation of health care providers demonstrate our dedication to living out the UH mission: To Heal. To Teach. To Discover.\n\nPlease note that University Hospitals Case Medical Center has changed its name to University Hospitals Cleveland Medical Center.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:21.654Z","channelId":"UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d5985b1fdb5106ceac2c4e23013117167946dd216e2906aa4cd9e4edc4a29125","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"38130dfd030ac2c51994b4bcaf7556659ed5b12d22e12770ba0f0302fcc4ccf9"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:21.654Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":32700,"raw":"32.7K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3o204QqPUa6V3q2m_9DZuQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:18:21.654Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"mat